\end{eqnarray} where $B_{M_k\mathbf{1}}$ is defined in Equation \ref{bk} and $N_k,L_k$ are defined in Equation \ref{NkLk}.
\end{corollary}

\pf Follows immediately from the discussions above and Theorem \ref{WQSPsum}. $\hfill\square$

\begin{remark}
\begin{enumerate}
   Indeed, for QSP the maximum element of $\mathcal{R}_{\mathbf{1}}=k$. Thus,  \begin{eqnarray*}
